  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 351.47,
      "e": 353.11,
      "text": "Well, we're here for a long period of time."
    },
    {
      "s": 353.11,
      "e": 356.23,
      "text": "And if we're not staying current on our skills,"
    },
    {
      "s": 356.23,
      "e": 357.47,
      "text": "kind of get dull."
    },
    {
      "s": 357.47,
      "e": 358.83,
      "text": "And it's not even just staying current,"
    },
    {
      "s": 358.83,
      "e": 359.99,
      "text": "it's staying proficient."
    },
    {
      "s": 359.99,
      "e": 361.39,
      "text": "So it's not just working to do it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 361.39,
      "e": 363.03,
      "text": "so you know how to go through it."
    },
    {
      "s": 363.03,
      "e": 364.67,
      "text": "It's so that there's muscle memory."
    },
    {
      "s": 364.67,
      "e": 366.83,
      "text": "So when you go out and launch on a real world mission,"
    },
    {
      "s": 366.83,
      "e": 368.23,
      "text": "you're ready to go, there's no doubt in your mind."
    },
    {
      "s": 368.23,
      "e": 369.31,
      "text": "You're not thinking through the steps,"
    },
    {
      "s": 369.31,
      "e": 371.15,
      "text": "it's just happening automatically."
    },
    {
      "s": 371.15,
      "e": 373.71,
      "text": "Our mission is to ensure that our fellow Airmen"
    },
    {
      "s": 373.71,
      "e": 375.87,
      "text": "have somebody there to pick them up"
    },
    {
      "s": 375.87,
      "e": 378.55,
      "text": "when they experience the worst day of their life."
    },
    {
      "s": 378.55,
      "e": 381.43,
      "text": "We're there to pick them up in any coalition member."
    },
    {
      "s": 381.67,
      "e": 384.67,
      "text": "For down-deercraft or people in bad situations."
    },
    {
      "s": 385.79,
      "e": 386.63,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "s": 386.63,
      "e": 389.91,
      "text": "We're always making sure that we're 100% ready"
    },
    {
      "s": 389.91,
      "e": 392.23,
      "text": "for the absolute worst-case scenario."
    }
  ],
